# Finish the Job

- After implementing the requested scope, run proportionate tests and at most
  one focused review pass unless the user explicitly asks for more.
- Fix concrete blockers and high-severity defects. Do not start repeated
  speculative review/refinement loops after tests pass.
- When the user requested commit, push, restart, or deployment, perform those
  handoff steps promptly once verification succeeds.
- Stop expanding the task when the requested outcome is complete.
